OL,3,GNEWSAUK's gaps in Arctic defence leave
OL,4,Ait open to Russian attacks, committee
OL,5,Awarns
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK has "glaring gaps" in its
OL,8,Fability to defend the Arctic region,
OL,9,Fleaving it vulnerable to potential
OL,10,FRussian attacks, a report by MPs has
OL,11,Fwarned.
OL,13,FThe Commons Defence Committee said a
OL,14,Fshortage of Royal Navy warships and
OL,15,Fsubmarines was leaving the country's
OL,16,Fcritical infrastructure in the High
OL,17,FNorth, including undersea cables and
OL,18,Fenergy supplies, exposed.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
